EDIT 1. Find this line, which is the closing brace of the function `surfaceSignalProblems` followed by a blank line and a comment:

    if (!Object.prototype.hasOwnProperty.call(signals, key)) problems.push(`surface ${key} has no hub-router.json routerSignals entry`);
